 in turn has a subclass that conforms to this protocol. A","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"feature object associates a shape with an optional identifier and attributes.","type":"text"}],"title":"MLNFeature","role":"symbol","fragments":[{"text":"MLNFeature","kind":"identifier"}]},"doc://org.swift.MyProject/objc(pl)NSSecureCoding":{"title":"NSSecureCoding","type":"unresolvable","identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/objc(pl)NSSecureCoding"}}}